    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "hey, so my neighbor has this massive automated hydroponic setup right by my window and the misting cycles are constant. every time it goes off, there's this really heavy, sweet chemical smell that drifts into my bedroom. i've been feeling super lightheaded and anxious lately whenever it's running. do you know any ways i can neutralize the airborne particulates so they don't get into my house?",
